[ar:Muse Demo Ensemble]
[ti:Small Signals]
[00:02.00]Small signals in the air
[00:06.00]Tell me someone else is there
[00:10.00]Every step becomes a sound
[00:14.00]Every echo comes around
[00:18.00]Leave a little room to grow
[00:22.00]Take the time you need to know
